  "releaseNotes": "A patch that closes the one gap 1.2.0 left in its text contrast. A selected list row or select option under the pointer turned grey and its coloured text fell to 2.9:1 in dark; it now keeps its colour, a little deeper, and its text reads at 4.5:1 in every variant.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/5f2dd5fedb73ae0e43f3850d4a8b3802f2cecbf0/docs/versions/1.2.1.md",
